          "ink": "black"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`$graphLookup` does recursive self-joins — org charts, category trees",
            "It takes `maxDepth`, `depthField`, `connectFromField`/`connectToField`",
            "`$unionWith` (4.4+) is UNION ALL — concatenates another collection",
            "One-to-few? Embed at write time; joins are for reporting"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "Empty results, no error",
          "items": [
            "Matching is exact BSON equality including type",
            "An ObjectId will never match its string form",
            "Fix with `$toObjectId` inside the lookup pipeline",
            "Check explain for COLLSCAN under the lookup"
          ],
          "ink": "red"
        },
